 demais?"},{"words":["warm","enough","No","it's"],"ans":"No it's warm enough","pt":"Não, está morno o suficiente."}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"enough","pos":"word","pt":"suficiente","ex":"Enough water.","expt":"Água suficiente."},{"w":"hot tea","pos":"word","pt":"hot tea","ex":"chá quente","expt":"Hot tea."},{"w":"small cup","pos":"word","pt":"small cup","ex":"xícara pequena","expt":"Small cup."},{"w":"loud room","pos":"word","pt":"loud room","ex":"sala barulhenta","expt":"Loud room."},{"w":"quiet corner","pos":"word","pt":"quiet corner","ex":"canto silencioso","expt":"Quiet corner."},{"w":"long day","pos":"word","pt":"long day","ex":"dia longo","expt":"Long day."},{"w":"short break","pos":"word","pt":"short break","ex":"pausa curta","expt":"Short break."},{"w":"deep breath","pos":"word","pt":"deep breath","ex":"respiração profunda","expt":"Deep breath."},{"w":"enough sleep","pos":"word","pt":"enough sleep","ex":"sono suficiente","expt":"Enough sleep."},{"w":"tired eyes","pos":"word","pt":"tired eyes","ex":"olhos cansados","expt":"Tired eyes."},{"w":"soft light","pos":"word","pt":"soft light","ex":"luz suave","expt":"Soft light."},{"w":"slow morning","pos":"word","pt":"slow morning","ex":"manhã lenta","expt":"Slow morning."},{"w":"calm mind","pos":"word","pt":"calm mind","ex":"mente calma","expt":"Calm mind."},{"w":"kind word","pos":"word","pt":"kind word","ex":"palavra gentil","expt":"Kind word."},{"w":"tea cup","pos":"word","pt":"tea cup","ex":"xícara de chá","expt":"Tea cup."},{"w":"noisy street","pos":"word","pt":"noisy street","ex":"rua barulhenta","expt":"Noisy street."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**Is the tea too hot?** — O chá está quente demais?","**No, it’s warm enough.** — Não, está morno o suficiente.","**Is the room too loud?** — A sala está alta demais?","**No harm done.** — Sem problema.","**It’s my bad.** — Foi mal.","**I owe you one.** — Te devo uma.","**You saved my life.** — Você salvou minha vida."]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"break","pt":"quebrar, interromper","forms":[["I / you / we / they break","I break a glass."],["he / she / it breaks","She breaks the silence."]]}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"Too or enough?","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"Too or enough?","lines":[["Ana","Is the tea too hot?","O chá está quente demais?"],["Leo","No, it’s warm enough.","Não, está morno o suficiente."],["Ana","Is the room too loud?","A sala está alta demais?"],["Leo","Yes. Let’s take a break.","Sim. Vamos fazer uma pausa."]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: Ligação entre palavras","items":[{"label":"Ligação entre palavras","note":"Consoante final liga à vogal seguinte: pick it up → pi-ki-tup.","words":["pick it up","turn it off","an apple","check in"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say something that is too much for you.","pt":"Diga.","model":"The music is too loud."},{"q":"Say something that is enough.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I have enough time."},{"q":"Ask: Is it …enough?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"Is it big enough?"}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write a 4-line poem with too / enough.","model":"The tea is too hot, / the day is too long. / Is there enough rest? / I take a break and I am strong.","checklist":["4 linhas","Usei **too e enough**","Rima simples"],"words":"4 linhas"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “loud” mean?","opts":["alto (som)","descanso","suficiente"],"ans":0,"why":"**loud** = alto (som)."},{"q":"What does “rest” mean?","opts":["pausa","descanso","caneca"],"ans":1,"why":"**rest** = descanso."},{"q":"What does “break” mean?","opts":["suficiente","vapor","pausa"],"ans":2,"why":"**break** = pau